{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2019-10", "window": 1, "start_date": 1569888000, "end_date": 1570492799, "month_true_total": 1818, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 18:59:32 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "55502227", "author": {"steamid": "76561198134899971", "personaname": "Wobbly", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198134899971/", "num_games_owned": 146, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 55458, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 27356, "last_played": 1781729600, "avatar": "b8591d1ec5a5f076ee5b6067c87eab231dc9b82f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Warframe is a great game but it needs new story content and fast. It's not going to die any time soon but there hasn't been any new story content since last year. or maybe even before that. New players will have months of content to go through.", "timestamp_created": 1570487953, "timestamp_updated": 1571318828, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55501735", "author": {"steamid": "76561197987561895", "personaname": "VinLian", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/VinLian/", "num_games_owned": 291, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 162849, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 103600, "last_played": 1612040002, "avatar": "548539e99de3535c6a8cda275db5c5d469d9bddf"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is so new player friendly.  When you do missions with randoms people are cooperative and help you and revive you.  There's lots to do and you'll put in over a thousand hours before you've come close to doing all the content.  There's also no mechanics that make you have to depend on your teammates to revive you.  You can revive on your own multiple times in every mission.  So it doesn't make missions a total failure if your teammates won't revive you.  Also the mobility in this game is great you can traverse around the maps very quickly.  They don't put in areas where it's really hard to get around in the normal missions.  All in all, the best free to play shooter out there for sure.", "timestamp_created": 1570484903, "timestamp_updated": 1570484903, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.477707028388977051", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55501005", "author": {"steamid": "76561198106954759", "personaname": "Adversary", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/airbear200/", "num_games_owned": 553, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 39006, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 48, "playtime_at_review": 1560, "last_played": 1788883735, "avatar": "58712dd9a0b094b0066a61068a9ea8fb5fbcc896"}, "language": "english", "review": "Ninjas Dude", "timestamp_created": 1570480591, "timestamp_updated": 1570480591, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55500577", "author": {"steamid": "76561198303401151", "personaname": "Dano216", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/dagriffith216/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 344588, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 104025, "last_played": 1787745198, "avatar": "1facb987d3c3778f8ce864d9795aa38f1886a211"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is a great game and worth the steep learning curve for beginners. Even as a veteran player, I often find myself having to seek out answers on the wiki page or on YouTube. This information is easy to find though. There is a ton of variety and the game is constantly evolving. \n\nThe 'free to play' aspect of the game is generous compared to other games. You can realistically play through the entire game  without spending a nickle, but it would be rather grindy. There are several opportunities to get plat (the in-game currency) at a discounted rate, or just by earning it in-game by selling weapon or warframe parts you earn simply by playing the game. \n\nI only wish it wasn't so addictive because I have a large Steam library that I ignore to play this instead.", "timestamp_created": 1570478476, "timestamp_updated": 1570478476, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55499704", "author": {"steamid": "76561198096297817", "personaname": "gOdPRI", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/noname1308/", "num_games_owned": 150, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 516, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 515, "last_played": 1571859940, "avatar": "148ff422f2245ab66abfeabf3f7506861d6b703b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Worst and boring game i ve ever played. I totally wouldn t recommend it.Better play metin2", "timestamp_created": 1570473818, "timestamp_updated": 1570473818, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.470021098852157593", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_